; ART MOCKUP (pixel-artist): Varadero town square - shop (sack sign) and enfermeria (heart sign) with
; chimneys, plaza path, sign, flowers, bush, barrel, shore and jetty. Leo (up) at (64,64); Tomasa,
; a fisherman, a neighbour; a Pinzarro on the shore; an item with its sparkle. Metatiles: res/metatiles.mt.
